# Guarantee a byte-identical checkout of the as-published artifacts on every
# platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true (the Windows default, and the setting on the
# machine this repo was created from) rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout. The
# working tree would then no longer match the MD5s recorded in the commit-1
# message, nor the SHA-256 digests in MANIFEST.sha256, and the integrity check
# would fail for reasons that have nothing to do with the contents.
#
# "-text" disables all end-of-line conversion. Files are stored and checked out
# exactly as committed.
* -text
